    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/ad3c18ff98408932f26ef8bde435c48f.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/ad3c18ff98408932f26ef8bde435c48f.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/ad3c18ff98408932f26ef8bde435c48f.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your beloved town is in danger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert 24/7 to keep the situation in the town under control. No fires or lost cats allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/SOS_10.gif?t=1755016113\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ok, you've received the emergency call.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries. Just start your engines and HURRY UP, YOU LAZY #*$%#@*&amp;$#&amp;*!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/SOS_02.gif?t=1755016113\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can try to fight the fire.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not that simple, and sometimes it can be a little dangerous, but people believe in you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/cb61169620c4c0aa5e485d66b4ac01e6.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/cb61169620c4c0aa5e485d66b4ac01e6.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/cb61169620c4c0aa5e485d66b4ac01e6.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Or you can play football.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, it's an emergency situation, but the ball seems so lonely here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/66b05cdb7ec27ebd96c94e4b7e705cca.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/66b05cdb7ec27ebd96c94e4b7e705cca.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/66b05cdb7ec27ebd96c94e4b7e705cca.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The cats are lonely too.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab them and find them a suitable place to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/b524fdb97f3c47f70fada9eb229861b7.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/b524fdb97f3c47f70fada9eb229861b7.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/b524fdb97f3c47f70fada9eb229861b7.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact us: pr@artdock.studio</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/ad3c18ff98408932f26ef8bde435c48f.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/ad3c18ff98408932f26ef8bde435c48f.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/ad3c18ff98408932f26ef8bde435c48f.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your beloved town is in danger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert 24/7 to keep the situation in the town under control. No fires or lost cats allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/SOS_10.gif?t=1755016113\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ok, you've received the emergency call.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries. Just start your engines and HURRY UP, YOU LAZY #*$%#@*&amp;$#&amp;*!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/SOS_02.gif?t=1755016113\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can try to fight the fire.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not that simple, and sometimes it can be a little dangerous, but people believe in you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/cb61169620c4c0aa5e485d66b4ac01e6.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/cb61169620c4c0aa5e485d66b4ac01e6.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/cb61169620c4c0aa5e485d66b4ac01e6.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Or you can play football.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, it's an emergency situation, but the ball seems so lonely here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/66b05cdb7ec27ebd96c94e4b7e705cca.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/66b05cdb7ec27ebd96c94e4b7e705cca.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/66b05cdb7ec27ebd96c94e4b7e705cca.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The cats are lonely too.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab them and find them a suitable place to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/b524fdb97f3c47f70fada9eb229861b7.poster.avif?t=1755016113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/b524fdb97f3c47f70fada9eb229861b7.webm?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/b524fdb97f3c47f70fada9eb229861b7.mp4?t=1755016113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact us: pr@artdock.studio</p>",
    "short_description": "SOS OPS! is more than a game. Your task is to save the city. You will find yourself in the epicenter of madness, where co-op missions with friends will raise the adrenaline to the limit!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Italian, Czech, Hungarian, Indonesian, Korean, Swedish, Thai, Vietnamese, Hindi, Swahili",
    "reviews": "\u201cOne of your friends is saving a waitress in a cafe, another one is trying to control the car, and what are you supposed to do? Whatever you want to!\u201d<br>The Journalix<br><br>\u201cI got a job as a firefighter in SOS OPS! A funny ragdoll game like Wobbly Life or Human Fall Flat but we do various jobs like firefighting and rescuing cats!\u201d<br>SpyCakes<br><br>\u201cBeautiful OB is checking out a new wobbly life type game called Sos Ops! We get to run around the city, find cats and do jobs in Sos Ops Gameplay!\u201d<br>Beautiful OB<br>",
